<title>BELGIUM: Punt not discussed by EU monetary committee.</title>
<headline>Punt not discussed by EU monetary committee.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union's monetary committee ended a meeting on Friday without discussing the strengthening Irish punt, committee sources said.</p>
<p>&quot;We have discussed (the items that were) on the agenda,&quot; one official said. The punt was not on the agenda.</p>
<p>Another said the Irish currency had not been raised.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom 32 2 287 6800</p>
</text>
